# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#  ACL — Access Control List Mosquitto
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Edge Golang service — akses penuh ke semua topic CNC
user edge_service
topic readwrite cnc/#
topic readwrite fanuc/#
topic readwrite oee/#

# Simulator Python — hanya boleh publish
user cnc_simulator
topic write fanuc/cnc/data
topic write cnc/dmg/sim/#

# Grafana — hanya baca (untuk live panel)
user grafana_reader
topic read cnc/#
topic read fanuc/#
topic read oee/#

# DMG Mori machine client
user dmg_mori
topic write cnc/dmg/#
topic read  cnc/dmg/#

# Makino machine client
user makino
topic write cnc/makino/#
topic read  cnc/makino/#
